    {
      "bbox": [
        455,
        1056,
        1204,
        1184
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "b. Simultaneously with issuance of the Quarterly Allocation and Personnel Ceiling Statement to each agency, OMB shall submit each such statement to the Office of the Comptroller. The Director of Management and Budget shall request the Office of the Comptroller to discontinue processing an agency's vouchers if the allocations or any category of such allocations set forth in any agency's Quarterly Allocation and Personnel Ceiling Statement shall be exceeded.",
