      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Monthly Expenditure and Personnel Forecasts shall be prepared as actual data are received concerning expenditures and personnel and in accordance with such other information as may become available. The Monthly Expenditure and Personnel Forecasts shall be adjusted in the third month of each quarter and may be adjusted during the quarter by the Director of Management and Budget to reflect the most current information consistent with the City's Financial Plan. The Monthly Expenditure and Personnel Forecasts will be based on actual experience and will reflect corrective action to assure continued performance to the City's Financial Plan.",
